  "goodToKnow": "Das Weltbild is a person's or a society's worldview, the picture of the world they carry: das mittelalterliche Weltbild, ein geschlossenes Weltbild. Das Weltbild geriet ins Wanken means that the worldview was shaken. A near synonym is die Weltanschauung, which English borrowed as a philosophical term. Also: das Menschenbild (the image of man). The plural is Weltbilder."
